### Dùng được trực tiếp trong IntelliJ IDEA (HTTP Client). Base URL:
@base = http://localhost:8080

### T01 - GET list (200)
GET {{base}}/api/categories?page=0&size=10&sort=categoryName,asc

### T02 - GET existing (200)
GET {{base}}/api/categories/1

### T03 - GET missing (404)
GET {{base}}/api/categories/32767

### T04 - POST valid (201)
POST {{base}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryName": "Technology News",
  "categoryDescription": "Technology and software engineering news",
  "parentCategoryId": null,
  "active": true
}

### T05 - POST invalid (400)
POST {{base}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryName": "",
  "categoryDescription": "",
  "active": true
}

### T06 - POST duplicate (409) - chạy lại T04 lần 2 cũng ra 409
POST {{base}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryName": "technology news",
  "categoryDescription": "dup",
  "active": true
}

### T07 - PUT existing (200)
PUT {{base}}/api/categories/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryName": "Academic & Research News",
  "categoryDescription": "Academic and research announcements",
  "parentCategoryId": null,
  "active": true
}

### T08 - PUT missing (404)
PUT {{base}}/api/categories/32767
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryName": "Ghost",
  "categoryDescription": "Ghost",
  "active": true
}

### T09 - DELETE free category (204) - SỬA id thành category bạn vừa tạo ở T04
DELETE {{base}}/api/categories/4

### T10 - DELETE referenced category (409) - Category 1 có NewsArticle
DELETE {{base}}/api/categories/1

### T11 - Search keyword (200)
GET {{base}}/api/categories?keyword=academic&page=0&size=5

### T12 - Pagination (200, bounded)
GET {{base}}/api/categories?page=0&size=2

### Break-It: text/plain -> 415
POST {{base}}/api/categories
Content-Type: text/plain

hello

### Break-It: sai method -> 405
PATCH {{base}}/api/categories/1
